# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/octo-t8 four-card DEVELOPMENT window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/octo-t8 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards
# are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from this branch by its author.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-octo-1 is a PLACEHOLDER for the tag B0 builds from the branch once the device pieces exist (serving_octo.DEVICE_PIECES;
# until then the attach refuses the flag by name and every octo arm fails at attach by design); substitute it in every template with one command
# (sed -i 's/tp4-octo-1/<tag>/' *.env). A commit of a file the image carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. The cards are under development: this window
# never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.

# L1 (THE LONE-USER PACKED ROUND, QWEN_FAST_SOLO_PACKED=1): c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-solopacked: a lone live user, and two or three in a block, take the padded 64-row T16 block instead of the 1/2/4-row per-request engines. The lone `coding` stream (one user) is the rate (the control, L0, runs the
# per-request engine at about 29 tok/s against 32.6 non-speculative); the drain (live 8 to 1) takes every user through the last rounds, and the budget ladder ends alone. READ: c2_smoke_check clean (its solo rule: at least one 'packed padded round live=1', no 'packed padded skipped live=1 eligible=1'),
# every text equal to L0's (octo_compare.py --control <L0 smoke log> --octo <L1 smoke log>), the lone coding stream's decode rate against L0's. GO: a lone user faster than the non-speculative 32.6 tok/s with every text exact. Needs a block that holds three idle segments (serving_octo.idle_capacity); until then the attach refuses. Soft.

C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-octo-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-solopacked
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,coding,concurrent8_drain,concurrent5_split
